  }, {
    "tStartMs": 376996,
    "dDurationMs": 3471,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "如果你要下车，\nrú guǒ nǐ yào xià chē，\nIf you want to get off,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 380916,
    "dDurationMs": 2261,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "你需要按\nnǐ xū yào àn\nyou need to press"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 383626,
    "dDurationMs": 907,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "按\nàn\npress"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 384676,
    "dDurationMs": 1440,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "这个按钮，\nzhè gè àn niǔ，\nthis button,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 387236,
    "dDurationMs": 640,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "按钮。\nàn niǔ。\nbutton."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 389036,
    "dDurationMs": 2080,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "这是扶手，\nzhè shì fú shǒu，\nThis is a handrail,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 392396,
    "dDurationMs": 2160,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "这是扶手。\nzhè shì fú shǒu。\nThis is a handrail."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 395996,
    "dDurationMs": 3440,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "在车上你需要\nzài chē shàng nǐ xū yào\nOn the bus you need to"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 400108,
    "dDurationMs": 2640,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "握紧扶手，\nwò jǐn fú shǒu，\nhold on to the handrail,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 404087,
    "dDurationMs": 2000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "握紧扶手\nwò jǐn fú shǒu\nhold on to the handrail"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 407010,
    "dDurationMs": 4720,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "好了，这就是今天的火车站学习，\nhǎo le， zhè jiù shì jīn tiān de huǒ chē zhàn xué xí，\nAlright, that's today's train station lesson,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 412115,
    "dDurationMs": 3840,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "我们再来复习一下今天的词语。\nwǒ men zài lái fù xí yī xià jīn tiān de cí yǔ。\nlet's review today's vocabulary."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 418050,
    "dDurationMs": 2800,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "首先，第一火车站，\nshǒu xiān， dì yī huǒ chē zhàn，\nFirst, the train station,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 422466,
    "dDurationMs": 2384,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "我在火车站。\nwǒ zài huǒ chē zhàn。\nI'm at the train station."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 426530,
    "dDurationMs": 3040,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "这是火车站站台，\nzhè shì huǒ chē zhàn zhàn tái，\nThis is the train station platform,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 430450,
    "dDurationMs": 3520,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "这是火车站站台。\nzhè shì huǒ chē zhàn zhàn tái。\nThis is the train station platform."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 435814,
    "dDurationMs": 2160,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "那个是火车，\nnà gè shì huǒ chē，\nThat is a train,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 438875,
    "dDurationMs": 2400,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "那个是火车。\nnà gè shì huǒ chē。\nthat is a train."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 444155,
    "dDurationMs": 3760,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "这个是公交车站台，\nzhè gè shì gōng jiāo chē zhàn tái，\nThis is the bus stop platform,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 448635,
    "dDurationMs": 3440,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "这个是公交车站台，\nzhè gè shì gōng jiāo chē zhàn tái，\nThis is the bus stop platform,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 452635,
    "dDurationMs": 2240,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "这是公交车，\nzhè shì gōng jiāo chē，\nThis is a bus,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 455755,
    "dDurationMs": 2400,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "这是公交车。\nzhè shì gōng jiāo chē。\nThis is a bus."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 459115,
    "dDurationMs": 3520,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "如果你需要坐火车，\nrú guǒ nǐ xū yào zuò huǒ chē，\nIf you need to take a train,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 463355,
    "dDurationMs": 4160,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "那么你需要到火车站站台；\nnà me nǐ xū yào dào huǒ chē zhàn zhàn tái ；\nthen you need to go to the train station platform;"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 468155,
    "dDurationMs": 3520,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "如果你需要坐公交车，\nrú guǒ nǐ xū yào zuò gōng jiāo chē，\nIf you need to take a bus,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 472235,
    "dDurationMs": 4480,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "那么你需要到公交车站台。\nnà me nǐ xū yào dào gōng jiāo chē zhàn tái。\nthen you need to go to the bus stop platform."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 477829,
    "dDurationMs": 4960,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "接着，我们在售票机上买票，\njiē zháo， wǒ men zài shòu piào jī shàng mǎi piào，\nNext, we buy tickets at the ticket machine,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 483528,
    "dDurationMs": 3421,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "我们在售票机上买票，\nwǒ men zài shòu piào jī shàng mǎi piào，\nwe buy tickets at the ticket machine,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 487829,
    "dDurationMs": 4560,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "我们在咖啡机上买咖啡，\nwǒ men zài kā fēi jī shàng mǎi kā fēi，\nwe buy coffee at the coffee machine,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 493349,
    "dDurationMs": 4480,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "我们在咖啡机上买咖啡，\nwǒ men zài kā fēi jī shàng mǎi kā fēi，\nwe buy coffee at the coffee machine,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 499029,
    "dDurationMs": 4640,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "我们在零食机上买零食，\nwǒ men zài líng shí jī shàng mǎi líng shí，\nwe buy snacks at the snack machine,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 504869,
    "dDurationMs": 4400,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "我们在零食机上买零食。\nwǒ men zài líng shí jī shàng mǎi líng shí。\nwe buy snacks at the snack machine."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 510789,
    "dDurationMs": 6080,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "上车以后，你需要给乘务员检票\nshàng chē yǐ hòu， nǐ xū yào gěi chéng wù yuán jiǎn piào\nAfter getting on, you need to have the conductor check your ticket"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 517710,
    "dDurationMs": 3600,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "你需要给乘务员检票\nnǐ xū yào gěi chéng wù yuán jiǎn piào\nyou need to have the conductor check your ticket"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 522162,
    "dDurationMs": 4400,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "好啦，这就是今天的火车站中文学习，\nhǎo lā， zhè jiù shì jīn tiān de huǒ chē zhàn zhōng wén xué xí，\nAlright, that's today's Chinese lesson about the train station,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 526967,
    "dDurationMs": 3120,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "你学会了吗？还有什么更想学的，\nnǐ xué huì le ma ？ huán yǒu shén me gēng xiǎng xué de，\nhave you learned it? What else would you like to learn,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 530722,
    "dDurationMs": 2081,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "在评论下方告诉我，\nzài píng lùn xià fāng gào sù wǒ，\ntell me in the comments below,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 533522,
    "dDurationMs": 480,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "拜拜。\nbài bài。\nbye-bye."
    } ]
  } ]
